{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6269": "CORDELIA: 是不是该在更靠近城市的地方降落？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6270": "NIKOLAI: 那只会被舰队打下来。或者被你们自己的守军打下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6271": "NIKOLAI: 你们国家有什么火炮？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6272": "JEROME: 博物馆里收着几门。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6273": "CORDELIA: 说过了，我们最好的防御就是魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6274": "NIKOLAI: 城里有多少人能用魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6275": "CORDELIA: 几乎所有人。这正是我们社会的根本。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6276": "NIKOLAI: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6277": "BEN: 听着是个好消息吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6278": "NIKOLAI: 军队的作战准则，是杀死所有敌方法师。不论男女老幼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6279": "AGATA: 连……危险程度都不评估？而且……孩子也不放过？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6280": "NIKOLAI: 他们认定，世界上的魔力总共就那么多。既然敌人占着一份，就得把那一份夺过来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6281": "ALEXANDRA: 就算他们的世界是那样……这里也不一样，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6282": "ALEXANDRA: 他们知道吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6283": "NIKOLAI: 尽量多救些人吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-chapter10start-6284": "JEROME: 从南边进城。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6285": "ALEXANDRA: 你们……跟魔物住在一起？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6286": "AGATA: 野生生物会被高度集中的魔力吸引。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6287": "NIKOLAI: 对，斯特拉尔被轰炸后，也出现过这种情况。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6288": "NIKOLAI: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6289": "NIKOLAI: 喂！干什么呢！？回屋里去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6290": "YOUNG MAN: 得了吧，像我这样小又不停移动的目标，他们打不中，该小心的是你们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6291": "NIKOLAI: 他们可不会打不中就停手，你得回屋里躲着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6292": "JEROME: 你们从哪儿来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6293": "BOY: 从河边跑来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6294": "YOUNG MAN: 大部分战斗都在北边，市中心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6295": "YOUNG MAN: 可这里也有几艘……飞船？一直盘旋着投炸弹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6296": "NIKOLAI: 要么找地方躲好，要么离开城市，情况只会更糟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6297": "YOUNG MAN: 得先找到我女朋友。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoSurvivors1-6298": "NIKOLAI: 该死！你根本——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6299": "WOMAN: 救命！求求你们！帮帮我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6300": "CORDELIA: 里面有谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6301": "WOMAN: 我的孩子！我出来收衣服，然后——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6302": "NIKOLAI: 几个？在哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6303": "WOMAN: 两个，也许在卧室？我不知道！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6304": "JEROME: 供水主管里的压力很低……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6305": "NIKOLAI: 不能用水系魔法，先灭掉一些火？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6306": "CORDELIA: 很快就会耗尽精力，到时就没法对付野兽和元素体了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6307": "NIKOLAI: 从水管里能取多少？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6308": "JEROME: 还有一点水和残留魔力，我可以施一道小法术，把它们系在我们身上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireHouse-6309": "NIKOLAI: 好，那就省着用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-firstFireStopper-6310": "WOMAN: 求求你们！除了你们，没人能帮我们了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningBoy1-6311": "NIKOLAI: 跟我们走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningBoy1-6312": "JUNA: 跳上来，孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningBoy1-6313": "BEN: 快点，走了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningBoy1-6314": "AGATA: 有我们在！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningBoy1-6315": "ALEXANDRA: 来吧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningBoy1-6316": "JEROME: 小家伙，没时间耽搁了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningBoy1-6317": "CORDELIA: 快些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningGirl1-6318": "NIKOLAI: 抓住我的手！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningGirl1-6319": "JUNA: 上来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningGirl1-6320": "BEN: 快快快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningGirl1-6321": "AGATA: 快过来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningGirl1-6322": "ALEXANDRA: 嘿！走吧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningGirl1-6323": "JEROME: 跟我们走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-burningGirl1-6324": "CORDELIA: 小姑娘，脚下小心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireSendBack1-6325": "NIKOLAI: 离这里越远越好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireSendBack1-6326": "JUNA: 知道你很吃惊，可现在得走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireSendBack1-6327": "BEN: 女士，该开溜了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireSendBack1-6328": "AGATA: 必须撤离，别回头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireSendBack1-6329": "ALEXANDRA: 你真的得走了，真的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireSendBack1-6330": "JEROME: 快逃出城吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireSendBack1-6331": "CORDELIA: 必须撤离，无论如何都不要回头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireSendBack1-6332": "WOMAN: 不用再说第二遍！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireSendBack1-6333": "还有人没救出来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6334": "MAN: 嘿！帮帮忙！这些火，我灭不掉！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6335": "NIKOLAI: 有人被困了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6336": "JUNA: 里面还有谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6337": "BEN: 谁出事了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6338": "AGATA: 有人困在里面？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6339": "ALEXANDRA: 糟了，里面有人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6340": "JEROME: 里面困了多少人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6341": "CORDELIA: 我们可以帮忙，里面有谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6342": "MAN: 呃，应该是……屋主、他的妻子[oxfordComma /]和两个孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopRunner-6343": "MAN: 祝你们好运！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6344": "MAN: 火太多，顾不过来！我是开店的，不是法师！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6345": "NIKOLAI: 里面还剩谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6346": "JUNA: 还有谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6347": "BEN: 里面还有什么人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6348": "AGATA: 还有谁没救出来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6349": "ALEXANDRA: 里面还有人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6350": "JEROME: 还有谁需要救援？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6351": "CORDELIA: 还有谁留在里面？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6352": "MAN: 我孙子、沃尔什夫人[oxfordComma /]和她女儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6353": "NIKOLAI: 不太妙……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6354": "JUNA: 来吧……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6355": "BEN: 看来只能靠我们了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6356": "AGATA: 交给我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6357": "ALEXANDRA: 我们来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6358": "JEROME: 我们会处理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDad-6359": "CORDELIA: 你在这里等着，我们进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreBoy-6360": "NIKOLAI: 走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreBoy-6361": "JUNA: 走吧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreBoy-6362": "BEN: 快快快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreBoy-6363": "AGATA: 快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreBoy-6364": "ALEXANDRA: 走吧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreBoy-6365": "JEROME: 跟我们来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreBoy-6366": "CORDELIA: 跟上！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreMom-6367": "WOMAN: 哦！谢天谢地！真不知道还能把火挡住多久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreMom-6368": "NIKOLAI: 快走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreMom-6369": "JUNA: 快，快，快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreMom-6370": "BEN: 该开溜了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreMom-6371": "AGATA: 快点！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreMom-6372": "ALEXANDRA: 快来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreMom-6373": "JEROME: 就是现在！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreMom-6374": "CORDELIA: 不要耽搁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreCheck-6375": "（里面还有人。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDebug-6376": "一个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDebug-6377": "两个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireStoreDebug-6378": "三个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsToUniversity-6379": "OLD MAN: 我们去大学！听说那里安全！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10downHere-6380": "VOICE: 嘿！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10downHere-6381": "WOMAN: 救救我们！这东西堵住了路！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockingMonster-6382": "NIKOLAI: 快！别待在空地上！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockingMonster-6383": "JEROME: 人都齐了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockingMonster-6384": "WOMAN: 等等我们！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockingMonster-6385": "WOMAN: 来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockedKeeper-6386": "NIKOLAI: 那些人在下面，简直就是活靶子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockedKeeper-6387": "JUNA: 不能丢下那些人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockedKeeper-6388": "BEN: 就这么把他们丢下，我们会后悔的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockedKeeper-6389": "AGATA: 我们不是来救人的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockedKeeper-6390": "ALEXANDRA: 得救他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockedKeeper-6391": "JEROME: 该怎么做，我们心里有数。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockedKeeper-6392": "CORDELIA: 一个人都不能丢下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-southBlockedKeeper-6393": "NIKOLAI: 那些人在下面，简直就是活靶子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopBlockedKeeper-6394": "NIKOLAI: 只要能救，就不能丢下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopBlockedKeeper2-6395": "NIKOLAI: 只要能救，就不能丢下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-skyHookIntro-6396": "等等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-skyHookIntro-6397": "LIEUTENANT: 指挥部，我们位于 2408-1020，未发现魔力集中迹象。增援到达后，立即派出巡逻队。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-skyHookIntro-6398": "NIKOLAI: 他们应该就是靠那种钩子，不着陆就把士兵送下来的，看来是新技术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-skyHookIntro-6399": "NIKOLAI: 得赶在增援到来前干掉他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-uniContactSouth-6400": "SOLDIER: 发现敌人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-uniContactEast-6401": "SOLDIER: 发现敌人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6402": "NIKOLAI: 哎，先等等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6403": "JUNA: 这样真好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6404": "BEN: 你在做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6405": "AGATA: 为什么要这么做？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6406": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6407": "JEROME: 能解释一下你的计划吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6408": "CORDELIA: 这里是大学，城里若有人能用魔法自保，那一定是他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6409": "CORDELIA: 这些火，并不怎么热，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6410": "CORDELIA: 果然。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6411": "NIKOLAI: 这样可能会暴露他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6412": "JUNA: 我们是不是弄坏了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6413": "BEN: 人家费了不少劲才弄好的吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6414": "AGATA: 施法的人会怎么想？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6415": "ALEXANDRA: 这样是对的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6416": "JEROME: 幸好布置这道幻象的人不是我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6417": "CORDELIA: 他们仍有保护，还有一道渐变幻象遮挡从空中望来的视线。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6418": "PROFESSOR: 啊，这不是杰出的赫尔蒙特小姐吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6419": "PROFESSOR: 火车都停了，你怎么从属地回来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6420": "CORDELIA: 说了，您也不会信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6421": "NIKOLAI: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6422": "JUNA: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6423": "BEN: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6424": "AGATA: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6425": "ALEXANDRA: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6426": "JEROME: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6427": "PROFESSOR: 不必太担心，古老的防护法术还撑得住，只是偶尔有炮弹从边缘漏进来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10illusionScene-6428": "PROFESSOR: 请进。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6429": "CORDELIA: 想找个真正了解这场危机的人，看来也太奢望了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6430": "CORDELIA: 我不想继续向北，除非——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6431": "LEONA: 别堵着门，继续走，找个地方待好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6432": "CORDELIA: 蕾欧娜！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6433": "LEONA: 科黛莉娅！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6434": "CORDELIA: 你怎么在这里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6435": "LEONA: 说实话，我本来想逃，可路被堵住了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6436": "LEONA: 不过，要说谁能带我们脱困，那一定是你，我看过报道，有位文书在属地打垮了一帮强盗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6437": "CORDELIA: 哪家报纸？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6438": "NIKOLAI: 没时间闲聊了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6439": "JUNA: 不想打扰，可是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6440": "BEN: 女士们，城还烧着呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6441": "AGATA: 时间紧迫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6442": "ALEXANDRA: 呃，我们是不是该……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6443": "JEROME: 抱歉打断重逢，不过还有很多事要做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6444": "CORDELIA: 确实，我们得救人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6445": "LEONA: 看来，你找来了一群……各有特色的帮手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6446": "LEONA: 既然这么坚决，就去大学街的东西两端看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6447": "LEONA: 只是推测，不过按幸存者的说法，外面可能还有……二十个人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leonaEnters-6448": "CORDELIA: 动身吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6449": "WOMAN: 喂！我邻居……应该还活着，楼上的窗边有人在动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6450": "NIKOLAI: 从底层进去没用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6451": "NIKOLAI: 先进左边那栋，试着跳过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6452": "JEROME: 又有个出水口，可以取些水和魔力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6453": "CORDELIA: 得再从消防栓引些水来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6454": "JUNA: 好，希望还有水。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6455": "BEN: 但愿水管里还没干。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6456": "AGATA: 还能从公共水管里取水吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6457": "ALEXANDRA: 好！取了水就进去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6458": "JEROME: 去大学，那边安全。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6459": "CORDELIA: 到大学避难，那里的防护仍在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6460": "JUNA: 你们两个快回大学，那边安全。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6461": "BEN: 你们俩赶紧回那个……反正就是那个大学。快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6462": "AGATA: 别留在这里，大学那边安全。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6463": "ALEXANDRA: 别待在这里！大学有地方避难！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-neighborsFireReport-6464": "NIKOLAI: 走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fireJump1-6465": "NIKOLAI: 墙上有个洞，可以从这里跳到隔壁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-rescueWestHouse-6466": "OLD WOMAN: 我……谁……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-rescueWestHouse-6467": "NIKOLAI: 该走了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-rescueWestHouse-6468": "NIKOLAI: 该走了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-rescueWestHouse-6469": "JEROME: 跟着我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-rescueWestHouse-6470": "CORDELIA: 来，走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-rescueWestHouse-6471": "AGATA: 跟在我们后面！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-rescueWestHouse-6472": "BEN: 该撤了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-rescueWestHouse-6473": "JUNA: 跟着我们！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-rescueWestHouse-6474": "ALEXANDRA: 别怕！来吧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10windExit-6475": "OLD WOMAN: 怎、怎么办？这么高，怎么——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10windExit-6476": "BEN: 啊，别担心这个，我会接住你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10windExit-6477": "OLD WOMAN: 你的……身体，真能接得住？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10windExit-6478": "BEN: 用魔法接，女士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10windExit-6479": "BEN: 这整个国家的人，怎么都爱以貌取人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10windExit-6480": "BEN: 总之，来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10windExit-6481": "OLD WOMAN: 总不能指望我们也像你们那样跳——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10windExit-6482": "JUNA: 不用，站稳一下就好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10windExit-6483": "BEN: 这就觉得厉害了？真该尝尝我做的穆萨卡。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10westReminder-6484": "NIKOLAI: 还得检查西南那栋，才能确认这里没人了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6485": "WOMAN: 我、我丈夫回去找儿子……然后……然后……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6486": "NIKOLAI: 这里不安全，得走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6487": "NIKOLAI: 这里不安全，得走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6488": "JEROME: 你已经帮不了他们了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6489": "CORDELIA: 女士，已经没有办法救回他们了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6490": "AGATA: 你已经尽力了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6491": "BEN: 他们已经不在了，咱们该走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6492": "JUNA: 嘿，看着我，别看他们，你已经帮不了他们了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6493": "ALEXANDRA: 不是你的错，你得离开这里了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6494": "NIKOLAI: 撤去大学，马上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6495": "NIKOLAI: 撤去大学，马上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6496": "JEROME: 带女儿去大学，那里安全。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6497": "CORDELIA: 请到大学避难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6498": "AGATA: 大学那边安全。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6499": "BEN: 带孩子去前面，跟大家躲在一起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6500": "JUNA: 大家都在大学集合，你们也去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-shopWidow-6501": "ALEXANDRA: 你和女儿去大学，就安全了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-factoryEstablishingShot-6502": "CORDELIA: 城里的工厂覆盖着大量防火魔法，看来是起了作用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-factoryEstablishingShot-6503": "NIKOLAI: 等等，看！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-factoryEstablishingShot-6504": "OFFICER: 指挥部，我们已抵达目标上方。建筑清理完毕后报告。不要消耗弹药。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-factoryEstablishingShot-6505": "NIKOLAI: 得快点了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-extFactoryGrenade-6506": "SOLDIER: 要爆破了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10factoryExtGuards-6507": "SOLDIER: 发现敌人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6508": "已救出 1 人",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6509": "已救出 {0} 人",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6510": "已救出 0 人",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6511": "NIKOLAI: 应该都救出来了，回去报告。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6512": "NIKOLAI: 应该都救出来了，回去报告。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6513": "JEROME: 人数应该够了。回大学？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6514": "CORDELIA: 看来人都齐了。回大学吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6515": "AGATA: 二十个了，回去报告。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6516": "BEN: 知道的就这些人了。你们说，大学管午饭吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6517": "JUNA: 都在了！回大学。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-survivorsSaved-6518": "ALEXANDRA: 希望没有别人了。回大学问问吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-factoryEntryAttack-6519": "LIEUTENANT: 开火！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-executionOverhear-6520": "等等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-executionOverhear-6521": "SOLDIER: 长官……非得我们做吗？安赛茨上校的旅不是要来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-executionOverhear-6522": "OFFICER: 只有夺取每一滴魔力，才能让火焰战舰继续飞。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-executionOverhear-6523": "OFFICER: 尽你的职责，士——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-executionOverhear-6524": "OFFICER: 南边有敌人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-executionOverhear-6525": "OLD MAN: 谢、谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10swEscape-6526": "NIKOLAI: 尽快离开这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10swEscape-6527": "NIKOLAI: 尽快离开这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10swEscape-6528": "JEROME: 去大学，快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10swEscape-6529": "CORDELIA: 该离开了，前往大学。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10swEscape-6530": "AGATA: 撤去大学，别出声。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10swEscape-6531": "BEN: 好了各位，快走。去前面跟其他人躲在一起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10swEscape-6532": "JUNA: 哎，该开溜了各位，去大学避难！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10swEscape-6533": "ALEXANDRA: 嘘！快离开这里，去大学！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10eSurvivor-6534": "WOMAN: 能……安全地过去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6535": "LECLAIRE: 我保证，他没死，至少现在还没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6536": "LECLAIRE: 炸弹碎片应该没有完全穿透……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6537": "CORDELIA: 勒克莱尔小姐？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6538": "LECLAIRE: 赫尔蒙特老师？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6539": "LECLAIRE: 抱歉让您接手，能帮一下吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6540": "LECLAIRE: 我把弹片从他的肺里排出来时，需要有人维持阿德恩缝合术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6541": "CORDELIA: 当然。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6542": "LECLAIRE: 好了，你得在诊所住一阵子，这种条件下，几乎肯定会感染。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6543": "CORDELIA: 你做得非常出色，但大家都得前往大学，袭击不会很快停下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10leclaire-6544": "LECLAIRE: 好，走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6545": "LEONA: 科黛莉娅！我就知道，你会做得比要求的还多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6546": "LEONA: 这里大概又多了十位幸存者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6547": "CORDELIA: 防护还撑得住吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6548": "PROFESSOR: 暂时还行，可袭击越来越频繁了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6549": "PROFESSOR: 恐怕他们已经看出些端倪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6550": "NIKOLAI: 他们正在试探，照这样下去，迟早会发现我们藏在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6551": "NIKOLAI: 军队里有专门受过这种训练的部队。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6552": "PROFESSOR: 那可不是什么好兆头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6553": "CORDELIA: 教授。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6554": "CORDELIA: 能否用卡吉尔矩阵，把这道渐变幻象剥离出来，让它随我们一起移动？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6555": "CORDELIA: 这样就能像撑起一把伞，用它掩护幸存者撤离。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6556": "PROFESSOR: 有难度，不过应该比留在这里好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6557": "PROFESSOR: 当然，得由你们开路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6558": "NIKOLAI: 带所有人原路返回，不行，太远了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6559": "CORDELIA: 离这里三个街区，就有一条大型地下铁路隧道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6560": "CORDELIA: 把幸存者向北疏散到车站，就安全了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10moveOut-6561": "CORDELIA: 走这边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6562": "NIKOLAI: 不妙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6563": "NIKOLAI: 要过去，得有多得多的水和魔力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6564": "NIKOLAI: 教授们能同时施两种法术吗？人手够不够？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6565": "CORDELIA: 不必。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6566": "CORDELIA: 请大家到这个消防栓后面排好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6567": "BEN: 知道你们国家讲究秩序，可这时候还……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6568": "CORDELIA: 对，很好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6569": "CORDELIA: 所有人一起，对消防栓施放“取水术”，就像小学里学过的那样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6570": "NIKOLAI: 你在做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6571": "CORDELIA: 正如你先前所说，这个国家人人都是法师。这正是我们社会的根本。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6572": "CORDELIA: 一起来，发挥每个人的力量。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10FireBlockNorth-6573": "CORDELIA: 好了。现在扑灭小片火焰，次数应该几乎不受限制。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6574": "JUNA: 过来了……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6575": "AGATA: 安全了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6576": "ALEXANDRA: 成功了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6577": "JEROME: 快到安全的地方了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6578": "CORDELIA: 我们过去了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6579": "NIKOLAI: 这样就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6580": "NIKOLAI: 这样就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6581": "BEN: 赶紧离开这鬼地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6582": "ALEXANDRA: 安全了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6583": "NIKOLAI: 带大家上来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6584": "JEROME: 别急！待在幻象下面！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6585": "NIKOLAI: 稳着点……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6586": "????: 呼叫空中指挥部，这里是猎兵四号，完毕。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6587": "NIKOLAI: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6588": "OFFICER: 2408-1252 发现目标。大群人员使用某种幻象。建议集束燃烧弹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6589": "NIKOLAI: 不！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6590": "CORDELIA: 蕾欧娜！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6591": "GORDON: 老师！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6592": "GORDON: 赫尔蒙特老师？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6593": "CORDELIA: 我刚才……在……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6594": "CORDELIA: 戈登先生？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6595": "GORDON: 您没事就好，来，先站起来，我们离开这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6597": "ALEXANDRA: 嘿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6598": "ALEXANDRA: 你……还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6599": "GORDON: 老师，刚才那种魔法，真可怕。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6600": "CORDELIA: 那是禁术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6601": "CORDELIA: 迪亚孔已无法正常运作，也就再没有什么能阻止我们使用任何一种法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6602": "JEROME: 我明白你为什么会冲动，可别忘了，上回你用这种法术，结果并不好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6603": "NIKOLAI: 而且对高级军官没用，他们钻研战斗魔法二三十年了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6604": "CORDELIA: 是啊，你当然清楚，杀多少人能当上尉？多少能当上校？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6605": "NIKOLAI: 对职业军队，你得明白——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6606": "CORDELIA: 怎么从没见过你们国家有人烤面包、砌砖？还是说，那些人也以杀人为乐？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6607": "NIKOLAI: 随你怎么看他们，可战斗时得冷静，否则我们没法指望——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6608": "AGATA: 如果还想救人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6609": "AGATA: 想救人，就得设法瓦解他们的空中优势。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6610": "NIKOLAI: 舰队的事我懂得不多，但一定有指挥舰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6611": "NIKOLAI: 干掉它，就能扰乱通信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6612": "CORDELIA: 我来带队。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6613": "JEROME: 那剩下的人就潜入迪亚孔，除了扰乱通信，我们也必须切断他们的能量来源。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6614": "CORDELIA: 胖子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6615": "BEN: 知道你记得我名字，不过这次就算了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6616": "CORDELIA: 你是风系法师，飞得怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6617": "BEN: 往上飞不稳，不过往下掉时，我能让大家慢下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6618": "NIKOLAI: 可以借他们放下来的钩子，把你们送上去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6619": "NIKOLAI: 我留在地面，去目标的路上火灾隐患太多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6620": "NIKOLAI: 齐卡隆也得跟我，不然听不懂你们说话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10civilianBombing-6621": "CORDELIA: 很好，接下来我要怎么对付你的同胞，你最好别看见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout1-6622": "MAN: 是在撤离吗？我带着家人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout1-6623": "BEN: 后面还有一大群人！跟他们一起！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout1-6624": "AGATA: 等其他人！我们正在撤离！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout1-6625": "JUNA: 嘿！等其他人来了，一起走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout1-6626": "NIKOLAI: 跟在我们后面，和其他幸存者一起！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout1-6627": "CORDELIA: 等其他人过来，一起躲在防护下面！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout1-6628": "NIKOLAI: 跟在我们后面，和其他幸存者一起！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout1-6629": "ALEXANDRA: 等等其他人！就在后面！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout1-6630": "JEROME: 稍等其他人，他们来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout2-6631": "WOMAN: 等等我们！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout2-6632": "CORDELIA: 先等在这里，等时机合适。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout2-6633": "JEROME: 在那里稍等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout2-6634": "NIKOLAI: 就在那里等一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout2-6635": "NIKOLAI: 就在那里等一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout2-6636": "BEN: 等等，后面还有人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout2-6637": "AGATA: 等一等其他人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout2-6638": "ALEXANDRA: 等大家都过来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leoBreakout2-6639": "JUNA: 等族群里其他成员过来！"
}
